  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till oberoende medier (Bianet) 2019-2024</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Independent Media (Bianet) 2019-2024 - Support to Independent Media 2019-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IPS aims to contribute to the transformation of Turkish media towards rights-based journalistic values and to become a reliable outlet of independent news with a rights-based, multi-voice approach.Bianet, the news portal of IPS Foundation, has become a model for free and independent news reporting with a rights-based approach. The objectives of IPS can be summarized under three headlines:
(I) The Editorial Desk works for enhancing the role of the media and becoming an example of independent news channel acting as an open space for sharing, and producing reliable and non-biased news on human rights.
(II) The Freedom of Expression Work monitors and publishes news and reports on the violations, developments and the struggle on Freedom of Expression and Press Freedom.
III) The Training and Capacity Building Work provides training programs and resource materials for the promotion of rights-based journalism with an aim to introduce independent and rights focused journalism.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IPS har som m&#xe5;ls&#xe4;ttning att bidra till omvandlingen av turkiska medier till r&#xe4;ttighetsbaserade journalistiska v&#xe4;rderingar och att bli en p&#xe5;litlig k&#xe4;lla till oberoende nyheter med ett r&#xe4;ttighetsbaserat, m&#xe5;ngsidigt tillv&#xe4;gag&#xe5;ngss&#xe4;tt. Bianet, nyhetsportalen f&#xf6;r IPS Foundation, har blivit en modell f&#xf6;r &#xf6;ppen och oberoende nyhetsrapportering med ett r&#xe4;ttighetsbaserat tillv&#xe4;gag&#xe5;ngss&#xe4;tt. M&#xe5;len f&#xf6;r IPS kan sammanfattas under tre rubriker:

(I) Redaktionsdisken arbetar f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka medias roll och bli ett exempel p&#xe5; oberoende nyhetskanaler som fungerar som ett &#xf6;ppet utrymme f&#xf6;r delning och ger tillf&#xf6;rlitliga och opartiska nyheter om m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter.

(II) Yttrandefrihetsarbetet &#xf6;vervakar och publicerar nyheter och rapporter om &#xf6;vertr&#xe4;delser, utvecklingar och om kampen om yttrande- och pressfrihet.

III) Utbildnings- och kapacitetsbyggnadsarbetet tillhandah&#xe5;ller utbildningsprogram och resursmaterial f&#xf6;r att fr&#xe4;mja r&#xe4;ttighetsbaserad journalistik med m&#xe5;let att inf&#xf6;ra oberoende och r&#xe4;ttighetsfokuserad journalistik.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention aims to increase the quality of journalism standards in Turkey by way of disseminating principles of ethical journalism with a human rights based approach (HRBA). This is done via both Bianet&apos;s own publishing as well as its capacity building activities. The objectives of IPS can be summarized under three headlines:(I) The Editorial Desk works for enhancing the role of the media and becoming an example of independent news channel acting as an open space for sharing, and producing reliable and non-biased news on human rights.(II) The Freedom of Expression Work monitors and publishes news and reports on the violations, developments and the struggle on Freedom of Expression (FoE) and Press Freedom.III) The Training and Capacity Building Work provides training programs and resource materials for the promotion of rights-based journalism with an aim to introduce independent and rights focused journalism..</narrative>
  </description>
